<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northern Telecom raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northern Telecom raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Northern Telecom Ltd to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- The firm said it made the change during Monday's trading session.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 5/8 at 69-1/4 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
